 Saloum and one blessed with a strong magical bloodline. Reborn with all his memories intact, along with the perfect bloodline and immense talent, he was determined to enjoy his new life, using his extraordinary magical abilities to master the study of magic that was beyond his reach in his previous life!\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)"},"tags":[{"name":"Magic","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Reincarnation","rank":85,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Femboy","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Demons","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Creature Taming","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Assassins","rank":73,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Chibi","rank":71,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Medieval","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Spearplay","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Maids","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Age Regression","rank":61,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":54,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Cute Boys Doing Cute Things","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Angels","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Skeleton","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Incest","rank":49,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Chuunibyou","rank":47,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Clone","rank":45,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":33,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince so I Can Take My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability","english":"I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince so I Can Take My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability","native":"転生したら第七王子だったので、気ままに魔術を極めます","romaji":"Tensei Shitara Dai Nana Ouji Datta node, Kimamani Majutsu wo Kiwamemasu","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"转生为第七王子，随心所欲的魔法学习之路"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"转生七王子的魔法全解"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Tensei Shita